[center][size=7][color=#4FAA3C][b]FRONTS & RIVALS[/b][/color][/size]
[size=5][color=#FFFFFF]A turf war for GTA V Enhanced Story Mode by Retch*[/color][/size][/center]

[size=4][color=#FFFFFF]Three rival crews hold every business in Los Santos. Take their fronts by force, staff them with your own crew, and hold them when the crews come back for them. It runs alongside the whole story, plays like part of GTA V and pauses during missions.[/color][/size]
[line]
[size=6][color=#4FAA3C][b]Your Empire[/b][/color][/size]
[size=4][color=#FFFFFF][list]
[*]29 real Los Santos businesses to take over, from car washes and liquor stores to motels, bars, clubs and factories[/*]
[*]Every front starts in a rival crew's hands and nothing is for sale, so you take what you want by force[/*]
[*]Your first front comes empty, so you hire and post your own crew, with a help box showing how[/*]
[*]Small fronts are an easy start, while mid-size and big fronts pay more and fight much harder[/*]
[*]Every front pays out at midnight, and earns more the longer you hold it and the more you own[/*]
[*]Upgrade fronts with cameras, floodlights, reinforced doors and an armory, depending on their size[/*]
[/list][/color][/size]
[size=6][color=#4FAA3C][b]Your Crew[/b][/color][/size]
[size=4][color=#FFFFFF][list]
[*]Recruits with names, faces, ranks and skills like the player's, rolled fresh every game and priced by how good they are[/*]
[*]Guards improve the longer they work for you and unlock better guns as they rank up, from a knife to a carbine rifle[/*]
[*]Body armour stays on them, and they heal and re-armour after every fight[/*]
[*]Guards patrol around their front while someone always holds the door[/*]
[*]Earn bodyguards as you grow, the first at 8 fronts and a second at 14[/*]
[*]Send a raid of your best guards to take a rival front without you[/*]
[*]Pick your crew's colour from 19 options and a style to wear it in: Street, Smart, Biker or Mixed[/*]
[*]Your own crew hangs out, walks and cruises around the fronts you own[/*]
[/list][/color][/size]
[size=6][color=#4FAA3C][b]Rival Crews[/b][/color][/size]
[size=4][color=#FFFFFF][list]
[*][color=#3CB371][b]Dead Kings[/b][/color] in forest green streetwear, [color=#F07F1E][b]Hellfire MC[/b][/color] in orange biker vests and the [color=#4A7BFF][b]Vinewood Elite[/b][/color] in royal blue suits[/*]
[*]Every crew member wears their colour on a major piece of clothing, so you always know who you're fighting[/*]
[*]Each crew has a boss, lieutenants, its own guns and three tiers of vehicles, from beaters to armoured luxury cars[/*]
[*]Crews hang out, walk the block and cruise their turf, fight each other in the street and draw the police[/*]
[*]Now and then a crew member mugs someone, carjacks a driver, gets chased by the cops or bundles someone into a car[/*]
[*]Leaders who escape come back with scars and hold a grudge[/*]
[/list][/color][/size]
[size=6][color=#4FAA3C][b]Fights[/b][/color][/size]
[size=4][color=#FFFFFF][list]
[*]Attacks come with no warning, and a timer shows how long your guards can hold[/*]
[*]Race back and fight beside them for a bonus, or trust your guards[/*]
[*]Everyone in a fight has twice the usual health, so firefights last[/*]
[*]Take out every soldier at a front and it's yours on the spot, with a shot of the building and the mission passed banner[/*]
[*]Running soldiers over counts, but the whole front opens fire on your car and calls in a crew car of backup[/*]
[*]Street heat rises with every front you take and cools each night, and the hotter it gets the harder the crews push back[/*]
[/list][/color][/size]
[size=6][color=#4FAA3C][b]Made For Story Mode[/b][/color][/size]
[size=4][color=#FFFFFF][list]
[*]Balanced for Story Mode money and length, so it lasts your whole playthrough[/*]
[*]Pauses during missions, cutscenes and character switches[/*]
[*]The Office is a GTA-style menu: hold Back/View (M on keyboard), or call it from your phone with iFruitAddon2[/*]
[*]Full controller support, and difficulty from Relaxed to Brutal[/*]
[*]Safeguards built in: clothing checked against your game, fewer street groups when the frame rate drops, and a save copy kept before every update[/*]
[/list][/color][/size]
[line]
[size=6][color=#4FAA3C][b]Requirements[/b][/color][/size]
[size=4][color=#FFFFFF][list]
[*]GTA V Enhanced, Story Mode, BattlEye disabled[/*]
[*][url=http://www.dev-c.com/gtav/scripthookv/]Script Hook V[/url][/*]
[*][url=https://github.com/Chiheb-Bacha/ScriptHookVDotNetEnhanced/releases]Script Hook V .NET Enhanced[/url][/*]
[*][url=https://github.com/LemonUIbyLemon/LemonUI/releases]LemonUI[/url] (SHVDN3 build)[/*]
[*][url=https://github.com/Bob74/iFruitAddon2/releases]iFruitAddon2[/url] (optional, adds the Office to your phone)[/*]
[/list][/color][/size]
[size=6][color=#4FAA3C][b]Install[/b][/color][/size]
[size=4][color=#FFFFFF][list=1]
[*]Install the requirements[/*]
[*]Copy the contents of the included scripts folder into your GTA V scripts folder[/*]
[*]Start Story Mode, and after Franklin's first mission a help box points you to your first front[/*]
[/list][/color][/size]
[size=6][color=#4FAA3C][b]Known Issues[/b][/color][/size]
[size=4][color=#FFFFFF][list]
[*]Some fronts have fewer guard posts where the street layout leaves no safe spot[/*]
[*]Not yet tested on the Legacy edition[/*]
[/list][/color][/size]
[size=6][color=#4FAA3C][b]Credits[/b][/color][/size]
[size=4][color=#FFFFFF][list]
[*]Clothing names and IDs: [url=https://github.com/root-cause/v-clothingnames]root-cause/v-clothingnames[/url] and [url=https://github.com/root-cause/v-besttorso]root-cause/v-besttorso[/url][/*]
[*]Ped and vehicle data: [url=https://github.com/DurtyFree/gta-v-data-dumps]DurtyFree/gta-v-data-dumps[/url][/*]
[*]LemonUI, iFruitAddon2, Script Hook V and Script Hook V .NET Enhanced, which are required but not included[/*]
[/list][/color][/size]
[size=4][color=#FFFFFF][i]*AI-directed by Retch: designed, directed and playtested by Retch, with the code, data and this description written with Claude, an AI assistant from Anthropic.[/i][/color][/size]

[center][size=4][color=#FFFFFF]Source code and every release on [url=https://github.com/RetchERez/FrontsAndRivals]GitHub[/url]
Single-player only. It switches itself off in GTA Online. Free, and not affiliated with Rockstar Games.[/color][/size][/center]
